{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0df1841e-c4f9-8ff9-9936-e7dc79112917",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T10:55:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Odete Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. It's the edge of the road, where it curves, it's all breaking off now. I figured somebody would've seen it by this point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, let me get some details so I know which road we're talking about. Where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:51:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bridge Street. 125 Bridge Street, on the Point. Right where it bends, in front of the house there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:52:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 125 Bridge Street. And when you say the edge is breaking off, is that the pavement crumbling along the side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:52:12-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The asphalt at the edge is coming apart in chunks. There's gravel out into the road. And it's right in the bike lane, so that's the part that bothers me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in the bike lane. Okay. How big an area, would you say? Just roughly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, maybe four or five feet along the curve. It's gotten worse since the freeze. It was a small crack in the fall and now pieces are missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:52:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, the freezing and thawing does that. Is there a hole, or is it just the edge breaking away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:52:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the edge. There's one spot that's dipped down a few inches, though. Somebody on a bicycle could catch a wheel in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:53:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll write that down. Anything else you can see, like is it close to a drain or a utility cover?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:53:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no drain that I can see. It's just the edge of the pavement, on the curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:53:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could you add the street to the repair list? That's what I'm asking. I don't know how you do it, but I'd like Bridge Street on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:53:51-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll enter it as a road edge repair at 125 Bridge Street, in the bike lane, on the curve. That goes to the crew supervisors and they sort out the order. I can't tell you the day it'll get done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:54:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I understand they have a lot of streets. I just want it on there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:54:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'll be on there. Can I get your name and a number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:54:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Odete Spencer. S-P-E-N-C-E-R. The number is 401-555-0176."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:54:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Odete Spencer, 401-555-0176. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:54:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:54:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Are you home during the day if someone needs to come by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm home right now. I work on a landscaping crew, but we're off for the winter, so I'm around most days until spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:54:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that helps. I'll note that. If someone from the crew stops by, they'll know to look for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:55:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. They can just knock. The curve is right in front, they can't miss it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:55:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can do for you today, Ms. Spencer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:55:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good rest of your day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:55:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
